an class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection</span></code></a>\n1073:and the <em>autocommit</em> parameter to <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.connect\" title=\"sqlite3.connect\"><code class=\"xref py py-func docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.connect()</span></code></a>\n1075:<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3-transaction-control-autocommit\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">transaction handling</span></a>.\n1078:<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection.load_extension\" title=\"sqlite3.Connection.load_extension\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection.load_extension()</span></code></a>,\n1079:for overriding the SQLite extension entry point.\n1081:<li><p>Add <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection.getconfig\" title=\"sqlite3.Connection.getconfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection.getconfig()</span></code></a> and\n1082:<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection.setconfig\" title=\"sqlite3.Connection.setconfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection.setconfig()</span></code></a> to <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection\" title=\"sqlite3.Connection\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection</span></code></a>\n1449:<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#module-sqlite3\" title=\"sqlite3: A DB-API 2.0 implementation using SQLite 3.x.\"><code class=\"xref py py-mod docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3</span></code></a>:</p>\n1451:<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3-default-converters\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">default adapters and converters</span></a> are now deprecated.\n1452:Instead, use the <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3-adapter-converter-recipes\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">Adapter and converter recipes</span></a>\n1455:<li><p>In <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Cursor.execute\" title=\"sqlite3.Cursor.execute\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">execute()</span></code></a>, <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/exceptions.html#DeprecationWarning\" title=\"DeprecationWarning\"><code class=\"xref py py-exc docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DeprecationWarning</span></code></a> is now emitted\n1456:when <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3-placeholders\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">named placeholders</span></a> are used together with\n1459:as a sequence will raise a <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.ProgrammingError\" title=\"sqlite3.ProgrammingError\"><code class=\"xref py py-exc docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ProgrammingError</span></code></a>.\n1626:<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#module-sqlite3\" title=\"sqlite3: A DB-API 2.0 implementation using SQLite 3.x.\"><code class=\"xref py py-mod docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3</span></code></a>:</p>\n1629:<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Cursor.execute\" title=\"sqlite3.Cursor.execute\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">execute()</span></code></a> and <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Cursor.executemany\" title=\"sqlite3.Cursor.executemany\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">executemany()</span></code></a>\n1630:if <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3-placeholders\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">named placeholders</span></a> are used and\n2297:<h3>sqlite3<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id2\" title=\"Link to this heading\">¶</a></h3>\n2299:<li><p>The following undocumented <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#module-sqlite3\" title=\"sqlite3: A DB-API 2.0 implementation using SQLite 3.x.\"><code class=\"xref py py-mod docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3</span></code></a> features, deprecated in Python\n2302:<li><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.enable_shared_cache()</span></code></p></li>\n2303:<li><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.OptimizedUnicode</span></code></p></li>\n2307:<p>The <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.OptimizedUnicode</span></code> text factory has been an alias for\n3254:<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#sqlite3\">sqlite3</a></li>\n3294:<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#id2\">sqlite3</a></li>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1787137261020},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"EYJrNokHpxFnnn2DyYlCadplQoguapgW","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"sed -n '1066,1100p' /tmp/py312_whatsnew.html"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"aios-llamacpp","model":"Qwen","usage":{"input":1797,"output":50,"cacheRead":32829,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":34676,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1787137261021,"responseId":"chatcmpl-IjnPHa0QdTrVQ5w2bNA2HY4BHrPf7y66","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"EYJrNokHpxFnnn2DyYlCadplQoguapgW","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<section id=\"sqlite3\">\n<h3>sqlite3<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#sqlite3\" title=\"Link to this heading\">¶</a></h3>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Add a <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3-cli\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">command-line interface</span></a>.\n(Contributed by Erlend E. Aasland in <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/77617\">gh-77617</a>.)</p></li>\n<li><p>Add the <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection.autocommit\" title=\"sqlite3.Connection.autocommit\"><code class=\"xref py py-attr docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection.autocommit</span></code></a> attribute\nto <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection\" title=\"sqlite3.Connection\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection</span></code></a>\nand the <em>autocommit</em> parameter to <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.connect\" title=\"sqlite3.connect\"><code class=\"xref py py-func docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.connect()</span></code></a>\nto control <span class=\"target\" id=\"index-25\"></span><a class=\"pep reference external\" href=\"https://peps.python.org/pep-0249/\"><strong>PEP 249</strong></a>-compliant\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3-transaction-control-autocommit\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">transaction handling</span></a>.\n(Contributed by Erlend E. Aasland in <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/83638\">gh-83638</a>.)</p></li>\n<li><p>Add <em>entrypoint</em> keyword-only parameter to\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection.load_extension\" title=\"sqlite3.Connection.load_extension\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection.load_extension()</span></code></a>,\nfor overriding the SQLite extension entry point.\n(Contributed by Erlend E. Aasland in <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/103015\">gh-103015</a>.)</p></li>\n<li><p>Add <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection.getconfig\" title=\"sqlite3.Connection.getconfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection.getconfig()</span></code></a> and\n<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection.setconfig\" title=\"sqlite3.Connection.setconfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection.setconfig()</span></code></a> to <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection\" title=\"sqlite3.Connection\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sqlite3.Connection</span></code></a>\nto make configuration changes to a database connection.\n(Contributed by Erlend E. Aasland in <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/103489\">gh-103489</a>.)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section id=\"statistics\">\n<h3>statistics<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#statistics\" title=\"Link to this heading\">¶</a></h3>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Extend <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/statistics.html#statistics.correlation\" title=\"statistics.correlation\"><code class=\"xref py py-func docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">statistics.correlation()</span></code></a> to include as a <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ranked</span></code> method\nfor computing the Spearman correlation of ranked data.\n(Contributed by Raymond Hettinger in <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/95861\">gh-95861</a>.)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section id=\"sys\">\n<h3>sys<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#sys\" title=\"Link to this heading\">¶</a></h3>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Add the <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sys.monitoring.html#module-sys.monitoring\" title=\"sys.monitoring: Access and control event monitoring\"><code class=\"xref py py-mod docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sys.monitoring</span></code></a> namespace to expose the new <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#whatsnew312-pep669\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">PEP 669</span></a> monitoring API.\n(Contributed by Mark Shannon in <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/103082\">gh-103082</a>.)</p></li>\n<li><p>Add <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../library/sys.html#sys.activate_stack_trampoline\" title=\"sys.activate_stack_trampoline\"><code class=\"xref py py-func docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">sys.activate_stack_trampoline()</span></code></a> and\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1787137276593},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now let me get the SQLite transaction documentation and also check Python 3.14 whatsnew:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"BWA1XvJdobULTpR4EexQ6Dc6VOjfiG6Z","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"curl -sL \"https://docs.python.org/3.14/whatsnew/3.14.html\" -o /tmp/py314_whatsnew.html 2>&1 && wc -c /tmp/py314_whatsnew.html","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"aios-llamacpp","model":"Qwen","usage":{"input":1372,"output":115,"cacheRead":34677,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":36164,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1787137276594,"responseId":"chatcmpl-aDbscQ8rjU4OUoJT7Ecj4jglMU1A7NjA","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"BWA1XvJdobULTpR4EexQ6Dc6VOjfiG6Z","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"535565 /tmp/py314_whatsnew.html\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1787137332525},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"QN7QH1O2RX1r8YTFQvagWYtMReuxWPfi","name":"bash","arg